{"id":"n15364-4-7","stage":4,"title":"감기다 · 可口","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15364-4-7-1","ko":"오늘따라 고기가 정말 맛있지 않아요?","zh":"今天这肉真的特别好吃吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘따라","meaning":"今天","explanation":"오늘：今天；따라：强调某个时间、场合等与平常不同，如 오늘따라（偏偏今天）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68207","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘따라","audio":"/audio/63be5b9d45dede0ea5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"고기가","meaning":"肉","explanation":"고기：肉；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고기","audio":"/audio/645b9cec60f52032ad29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31685","senseId":"1","lemma":"고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고기가","audio":"/audio/770e541289bc6d76906d.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있지","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있지","audio":"/audio/a62ae66ac5f692010137.mp3"}},{"text":"않아요?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않아요","audio":"/audio/a3e2b4d007f43b3838eb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68207","definition":"在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"645b9cec60f52032","term":"고기","zh":"肉","audio":"/audio/645b9cec60f52032ad29.mp3","entryId":"31685","definition":"食用的动物肉。","pronunciation":["고기"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/02a42bc65e89c1c92b85.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15364-4-7-2","ko":"네, 아주 입에 착 감기네요.","zh":"是啊，口感非常好，非常入味。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"입에","meaning":"嘴，口","explanation":"입：嘴，口；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"입","audio":"/audio/c503f60b315f818ea268.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62276","senseId":"1","lemma":"입","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입에","audio":"/audio/7132ed77fe8139e731f9.mp3"}},{"text":"착","meaning":"刚好地","explanation":"착：刚好地。","readings":[{"term":"착","audio":"/audio/1d7f9e27f01c9b1ee343.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78248","senseId":"2","lemma":"착","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"착","audio":"/audio/1d7f9e27f01c9b1ee343.mp3"}},{"text":"감기네요.","meaning":"可口，合口味","explanation":"감기다：可口，合口味；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"감기다","audio":"/audio/a9ab0bfc2fad3b76722a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15364","senseId":"4","lemma":"감기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기네요","audio":"/audio/fc6f9a16256219a376a2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"c503f60b315f818e","term":"입","zh":"嘴，口","audio":"/audio/c503f60b315f818ea268.mp3","entryId":"62276","definition":"吃食物、发音的器官，指从嘴唇到喉咙的部分。","pronunciation":["입"]},{"id":"1d7f9e27f01c9b1e","term":"착","zh":"刚好地","audio":"/audio/1d7f9e27f01c9b1ee343.mp3","entryId":"78248","definition":"正合口味的样子。","pronunciation":["착"]},{"id":"a9ab0bfc2fad3b76","term":"감기다","zh":"可口，合口味","audio":"/audio/a9ab0bfc2fad3b76722a.mp3","entryId":"15364","definition":"食物对胃口。","pronunciation":["감기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c278edcc4a7f088447d9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15364","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"고급","day":146,"sequenceScore":2.9067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，口感非常好，非常入味。","今天这肉真的特别好吃吧？","有多少人参加了聚会？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天这肉真的特别好吃吧？","有多少人参加了聚会？","是啊，口感非常好，非常入味。"],"answer":2}]}
